{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受词密度明显高于X，尤其S01、S02、S06，纵向连续扫读时容易被大量相近的情绪描述分散注意力，X的左右分栏更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然扫读负担更重，但加亮的关键词能让普通观众迅速抓住每段心理转折，而且人物为什么怀念、为什么抗拒、为什么最终选择继续向前，交代得更具体。它的音乐感受也更细腻，尤其通过有明确出现时机的描述，把旋律、节奏、音色变化和人物内心活动联系起来，使前后情绪转变更容易被听见和理解。X更清爽，但部分音乐感受被概括得较粗，人物心理与音乐细节之间的对应也没有Y充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "817de903-8fa3-4a15-8d2b-07c9d2e99e07", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231010824720Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:10:45.109149+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb2b52128d6475e4f437ca68a20783210e1a41166d711791e9d39f1a52fade2e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we